  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A minor accessibility / usability annoyance for screen reader users. Please set the expectations correct when loading a page for the first time.\n\nAffected URL: https://wiki.vrchat.com/ during a maintenance.\n\nExpected result: Set the expectation right from the beginning with `<title>VRChat  — Under maintenance</title>`, before the page contents are read.\n\nActual result: The first thing read out loud is the page title \"VRChat\" (`<title>VRChat</title>`, indicating no error), followed by reading aloud [\"underscore underscore forward slash forward slash backwards slash V forward slash\" noise from the incorrectly marked up ASCII logo](https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/the-ascii-logo-in-vrchat-maintenance-notice-as-seen-on-vrchat-wiki-is-not-access), before getting to the actual content which says the page is unavailable.",
